Summary
=======

Problem:
Misconfigured or unauthorized links can affect EtherChannel operation.

Solution:
Use PAgP negotiation with trunk hardening, VLAN restrictions, and security controls.

Benefit:
Provides reliable EtherChannel formation in Cisco-only environments.

Limitation:
Only works between Cisco devices.

